<title>UK: MAN UNITED BUYS HENNING BERG FOR 5 MLN STG.</title>
<headline>MAN UNITED BUYS HENNING BERG FOR 5 MLN STG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Premier League soccer club Manchester United Plc said on Monday that it has bought Norwegian defender Henning Berg from rival British club Blackburn Rovers, for five million pounds.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 1 542 7717</p>
</text>
